! Vocabulary Index

The vocabulary corpus grows as ''individual word tiddlers'', not one enormous list. This front page deliberately avoids rendering thousands of entries at once.

<div class="mandarin-note">Use [[Vocabulary by Lesson]] for bounded, context-aware word lists, or the sidebar search for an individual Chinese word or pinyin spelling.</div>

!! Target vocabulary standard

[[Vocabulary Standard]] — 2,000 fundamental, 3,000 high-use, 2,000 high-availability, plus 1–2k wuxia-specific items. The 95–98% coverage objective must be tested separately in conversation, written Mandarin, and wuxia.

!! Lesson groupings
* [[Lesson Vocabulary/L01]] — first sentences
* [[Lesson Vocabulary/L02]] — questions and negation
* [[Lesson Vocabulary/L03]] — sword lesson and wuxia context

